Zabbix – Filesystem: Time Left to 100%

1️⃣ Macros
Define at template or host level:

{$TIME_LEFT_DAYS} = 1 - Trend analysis window (how much history is used)
{$FS.PUSED.MAX.CRIT} = 99 - Target filesystem usage (%)

2️⃣ Iteam prototype
In discovery "Mounted filesystem discovery"  we have to add iteam

Name: FS [{#FSNAME}]: Time left to 100%
Type: Calculated
Key: vfs.fs.timeleft[{#FSNAME}]
Type of information: Numeric (float)
Formula: round(timeleft(//vfs.fs.dependent.size[{#FSNAME},pused],{$TIME_LEFT_DAYS},{$FS.PUSED.MAX.CRIT})/86400,2)
Units:d
Update interval: 1m

3️⃣Item Tags
component = storage
filesystem = {#FSNAME}
fstype = {#FSTYPE}

4️⃣Trigger Prototype
Name: FS [{#FSNAME}]: Less than {$TIME_LEFT_DAYS} day(s) left
Expression: last(/TEMPLATE/vfs.fs.timeleft[{#FSNAME}]) < {$TIME_LEFT_DAYS} and last(/TEMPLATE/vfs.fs.dependent.size[{#FSNAME},pused]) > 80
Recovery Expression: last(/TEMPLATE/vfs.fs.timeleft[{#FSNAME}]) > {$TIME_LEFT_DAYS} * 1.5
